{"title":"Polygon Tambora Reshapes Lighter, Faster Gravel Race Bike with 55mm Tire Clearance","link":"https://bikerumor.com/polygon-tambora-reshapes-lighter-faster-gravel-race-bike-with-55mm-tire-clearance/","date":1795102200000,"content":"<p><img src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Polygon-Tambora-all-new-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike-1536x1024.jpg\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"2026 Polygon Tambora affordable carbon fast gravel bike\" /></p>\n<p>Polygon completely reshapes their all-rounder fast gravel bike with an all-new carbon Tambora that is lighter than ever, much more performance-focused, and sports big off-road-ready 2.2″ tire clearance. Plus, even as Polygon describes it as their “fastest gravel bike to date”, it also adds internal frame storage and smart accessory mounting for bigger adventure rides, too.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2>2026 Polygon Tambora affordable carbon fast gravel bike</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_9-complete-on-orange.jpg\"><img width=\"2500\" height=\"1500\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_9-complete-on-orange.jpg\" alt=\"all-new Polygon Tambora carbon fast gravel bike: 9 on orange\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_9-complete-on-orange.jpg 2500w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_9-complete-on-orange-297x178.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_9-complete-on-orange-1536x922.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_9-complete-on-orange-120x72.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_9-complete-on-orange-768x461.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_9-complete-on-orange-2048x1229.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_9-complete-on-orange-1500x900.jpg 1500w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The new Tambora is a ground-up redesign, as Polygon aims to reposition the bike for gravel racing and fast all-day adventures. But not without plenty of backcountry capability, thanks to room for up to a 55mm tire being one of the new bike’s core considerations, and long fork legs that build in potential gravel suspension compatibility.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>While the previous generation of the Tambora was created as ‘one bike to do it all’, with so many mounts it was hard to count, plus an entry-level alloy frame option, now Polygon is working on another all-new gravel bike for more endurance adventure and bikepacking. That allowed their gravel bike designers to focus on speed for the Tambora.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3>What’s new?</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_on-a-gravel-road.jpg\"><img width=\"2000\" height=\"1500\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_on-a-gravel-road.jpg\" alt=\"all-new Polygon Tambora carbon fast gravel bike: riding\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_on-a-gravel-road.jpg 2000w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_on-a-gravel-road-297x223.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_on-a-gravel-road-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_on-a-gravel-road-120x90.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_on-a-gravel-road-768x576.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_on-a-gravel-road-1200x900.jpg 1200w\" /></a><figcaption><i>(All photos/Polygon)</i></figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Really, the new Tambora is a completely different bike. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>Instead of the previous generation’s blocky &amp; oversized sloping frame design, this all-new Tambora looks much more like a modern, semi-aero road bike. Smooth styling. A more open front triangle under a gently sloping toptube that will do better to fit any frame packs. Plus, a rear wheel cutout in the seattube, tall chainstays for drivetrain stiffness, dropped seatstays for comfort, and of course an upgrade to the UDH standard.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_angled-details.jpg\"><img width=\"2400\" height=\"1333\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_angled-details.jpg\" alt=\"all-new Polygon Tambora carbon fast gravel bike: frame details\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_angled-details.jpg 2400w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_angled-details-297x165.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_angled-details-1536x853.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_angled-details-120x67.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_angled-details-768x427.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_angled-details-2048x1137.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_angled-details-1600x889.jpg 1600w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Additionally, Polygon has included the same PolyPocket internal frame storage in the downtube, adapted from their popular <a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/polygons-new-collosus-t-might-be-the-best-value-in-mountain-biking/\" target=\"_blank\">Collosus T</a> mountain bike. And they put a recessed toptube bag mount just behind the headset. So you can securely bolt on a bag, or flush-mount a magnetic Fidlock adapter. Or stick with a smooth cover plate if you don’t want extra storage behind your stem.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3>New Gravel Race Geo, too</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_riding-singletrack.jpg\"><img width=\"2000\" height=\"1125\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_riding-singletrack.jpg\" alt=\"all-new Polygon Tambora carbon fast gravel bike: riding\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_riding-singletrack.jpg 2000w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_riding-singletrack-297x167.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_riding-singletrack-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_riding-singletrack-120x68.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_riding-singletrack-768x432.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_riding-singletrack-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_riding-singletrack-1600x900.jpg 1600w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Geometry on the new Polygon Tambora also gets a big update. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>First, there are now six sizes on offer (up from four) in the same overall rider height range to better fine-tune rider fit. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_new-gravel-race-goemetry.jpg\"><img width=\"2400\" height=\"1350\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_new-gravel-race-goemetry.jpg\" alt=\"2026 Polygon Tambora carbon fast gravel bike: all-new geometry\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_new-gravel-race-goemetry.jpg 2400w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_new-gravel-race-goemetry-297x167.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_new-gravel-race-goemetry-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_new-gravel-race-goemetry-120x68.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_new-gravel-race-goemetry-768x432.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_new-gravel-race-goemetry-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_new-gravel-race-goemetry-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_new-gravel-race-goemetry-1600x900.jpg 1600w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The new Tambora actually features shorter frame Reach figures than before, but much lower Stack numbers (down ~32mm) and a slightly slacker 70.5° head angle, which Polygon says improves stability and rider confidence, while also allowing for lower, more aero position on the bike. The new bike also gets longer chainstays to fit those big tires, paired with higher bottom brackets to balance agility and get rid of pedal strikes in chunky terrain.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3>Tech details</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_frame-detail-non-driveside.jpg\"><img width=\"2400\" height=\"1600\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_frame-detail-non-driveside.jpg\" alt=\"all-new Polygon Tambora carbon fast gravel bike: non-driveside frameset detail\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_frame-detail-non-driveside.jpg 2400w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_frame-detail-non-driveside-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_frame-detail-non-driveside-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_frame-detail-non-driveside-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_frame-detail-non-driveside-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_frame-detail-non-driveside-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_frame-detail-non-driveside-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_frame-detail-non-driveside-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_frame-detail-non-driveside-1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>all-new lighter &amp; stiffer ACX carbon frame and ACX carbon fork</li>\n\n\n\n<li>55mm max 700c tire clearance (<em>29 x 2.2″</em>)</li>\n\n\n\n<li>extended fork legs (435mm axle-to-crown) compatible with 40mm travel gravel suspension forks</li>\n\n\n\n<li>fully integrated internal cable routing </li>\n\n\n\n<li>stealth dropper post compatible</li>\n\n\n\n<li>compatible with 1x &amp; 2x, electronic AND mechanical groupsets</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_PolyPocket-internal-frame-storage.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1152\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_PolyPocket-internal-frame-storage-1536x1152.jpg\" alt=\"all-new Polygon Tambora carbon fast gravel bike: PolyPocket internal frame storage\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_PolyPocket-internal-frame-storage-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_PolyPocket-internal-frame-storage-297x223.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_PolyPocket-internal-frame-storage-120x90.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_PolyPocket-internal-frame-storage-768x576.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_PolyPocket-internal-frame-storage-1200x900.jpg 1200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_PolyPocket-internal-frame-storage.jpg 1777w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_flush-Fidlock-toptube-mount.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1152\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_flush-Fidlock-toptube-mount-1536x1152.jpg\" alt=\"all-new Polygon Tambora carbon fast gravel bike: toptube flush Fidlock mount\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_flush-Fidlock-toptube-mount-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_flush-Fidlock-toptube-mount-297x223.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_flush-Fidlock-toptube-mount-120x90.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_flush-Fidlock-toptube-mount-768x576.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_flush-Fidlock-toptube-mount-1200x900.jpg 1200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_flush-Fidlock-toptube-mount.jpg 1777w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>PolyPocket internal frame storage, including neoprene spares bag</li>\n\n\n\n<li>recessed toptube bag mount, optimized for a flush Fidlock mount</li>\n\n\n\n<li>three sets of bottle cage mounts</li>\n\n\n\n<li>T47 threaded bottom bracket</li>\n\n\n\n<li>27.2mm round seatpost, with wedge-expander clamp</li>\n\n\n\n<li>FM160 flat mount brakes</li>\n\n\n\n<li>12mm thru-axles</li>\n\n\n\n<li>UDH rear mount</li>\n\n\n\n<li>removable braze-on style front derailleur mount</li>\n\n\n\n<li>available in 6 sizes (XXS-XL)</li>\n\n\n\n<li>125kg (276lb) total system weight: rider+bike+gear</li>\n\n\n\n<li>1200g claimed frame weight (size M painted, with internal frame storage)</li>\n\n\n\n<li>made in Sidoarjo, East Java, Indonesia</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3>2026 Polygon Tambora gravel bike – Pricing, options &amp; availability</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-4-complete-scaled.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1152\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-4-complete-1536x1152.jpg\" alt=\"2026 Polygon Tambora carbon fast gravel bike: 4\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-4-complete-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-4-complete-297x223.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-4-complete-120x90.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-4-complete-768x576.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-4-complete-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-4-complete-1200x900.jpg 1200w\" /></a><figcaption>2026 Polygon Tambora 4</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-6-complete-scaled.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1152\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-6-complete-1536x1152.jpg\" alt=\"2026 Polygon Tambora carbon fast gravel bike: 6\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-6-complete-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-6-complete-297x223.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-6-complete-120x90.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-6-complete-768x576.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-6-complete-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-6-complete-1200x900.jpg 1200w\" /></a><figcaption>Tambora 6</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-7-complete-scaled.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1152\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-7-complete-1536x1152.jpg\" alt=\"2026 Polygon Tambora carbon fast gravel bike: 7\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-7-complete-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-7-complete-297x223.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-7-complete-120x90.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-7-complete-768x576.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-7-complete-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-7-complete-1200x900.jpg 1200w\" /></a><figcaption>Tambora 7</figcaption></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Polygon offers the all-new Tambora in four complete bike builds and six sizes (XXS-XL), all sharing the same new lighter ACX carbon frame &amp; fork.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Builds start at incredibly affordable pricing with the beige, black &amp; bronze $1800 / 1900€ Tambora 4, thanks to a cost-effective Shimano Cues 2×10-speed mechanical groupset and alloy Novatec wheelset. Next up at $2500 / 2300€, the red &amp; black Tambora 6 is still mechanical 2x Shimano, but upgraded to 2x12speed GRX for a more premium drivetrain feel. Then, at $3000 / 3500€, you get the seemingly 90s-themed white, blue &amp; pink Tambora 7 that Polygon upgrades to a wireless electronic 1x GRX Di2 setup, a carbon seatpost, and G29 carbon wheels from Novatec.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-9-AXS-complete.jpg\"><img width=\"2000\" height=\"1200\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-9-AXS-complete.jpg\" alt=\"2026 Polygon Tambora carbon fast gravel bike: 9 AXS \" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-9-AXS-complete.jpg 2000w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-9-AXS-complete-297x178.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-9-AXS-complete-1536x922.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-9-AXS-complete-120x72.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-9-AXS-complete-768x461.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_Tambora-9-AXS-complete-1500x900.jpg 1500w\" /></a><figcaption>2026 Polygon Tambora 9 AXS</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Lastly, the top-spec orange &amp; blue Polygon Tambora 9 AXS features, you guessed it, wireless SRAM Force Xplr AXS, the same carbon wheels, and a house-brand one-piece LINC integrated carbon cockpit.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_riding-front-view.jpg\"><img width=\"2000\" height=\"1125\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_riding-front-view.jpg\" alt=\"Polygon Tambora affordable carbon fast gravel bike: riding\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_riding-front-view.jpg 2000w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_riding-front-view-297x167.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_riding-front-view-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_riding-front-view-120x68.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_riding-front-view-768x432.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_riding-front-view-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Polygon-Tambora-affordable-carbon-fast-gravel-bike_riding-front-view-1600x900.jpg 1600w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>All four models are available now from your local Polygon dealer.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.polygonbikes.com/\" target=\"_blank\">PolygonBikes.com</a></p>","author":"Cory Benson","comments":"https://bikerumor.com/polygon-tambora-reshapes-lighter-faster-gravel-race-bike-with-55mm-tire-clearance/#comments","siteTitle":"Bikerumor","siteHash":"49f427af0a926f4232eb837006841d7242e153e3afbb590f32e4b104ea3e2718","entryHash":"07ee9d1037ff06d73875972bd802bde721df095f4bacc80b47b182e1bc072230","category":"Cycling"}